WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.780
Come on let's roll

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.780
Mitch! Hold up

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:05.140
Check this out

00:00:06.845 --> 00:00:09.565
Excuse me, that's a very nice scooter

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.640
Have you ever seen the Olympics?

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:13.380
Jesus why are you grabbing me so tight?!

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:14.840
Why the fuck are you driving?

00:00:14.840 --> 00:00:17.200
Stay off the grass, it's freshly fertilised.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:18.900
Stay on the path

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.200
I'm on the path man. They're right there!

00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.920
Watch it! watch it! 
Shut up!

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.380
There's a beautiful border collie right there, don't hit him

00:00:23.385 --> 00:00:24.860
Oh my god
You do not respect anything

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:28.740
Woah stop. Have some respect. Mummies and babies. Mummies and babies

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.520
Yeah I see them

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:31.820
Go get 'em. Stay on the pathway. You get the light one

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.120
Alright you're just slowing me down anyway

00:00:35.980 --> 00:00:36.980
Gimme your phone

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:43.580
Hey!

